    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέρ-ᾱμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>funnel, strainer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1088e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>hopper for lading corn in bulk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PThead.
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				27
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>): hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διερ-ᾱμᾰτίτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>contractor for use</i>
			of 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διέραμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1197.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
